-     The library has three source sets:
+     A biblioteca tem três source sets:

-     - `orthodoxy.oidc` — OpenID Connect: `Oidc.discover` for a provider's metadata, and
-       `Oidc.identify`, which verifies the ID token an `Authorization` carries with sigillate.
+     - `orthodoxy.oidc` — OpenID Connect: `Oidc.discover` para os metadados de um provedor, e
+       `Oidc.identify`, que verifica com sigillate o ID token que uma `Authorization` carrega.
